      ["data-validation", "Data Validation and Joins", "Check keys, join cardinality, and impossible values before modeling.", "Create assertions for row counts, unique identifiers, valid ranges, and join coverage.", "pandas Combining data", "https://pandas.pydata.org/pandas-docs/stable/getting_started/intro_tutorials/08_combine_dataframes.html"]
